~ start
if first == true:
	=>< Introduction
	set first = false
else:
	=>< Reintroduction
if check_feathers():
	What will you do?
	- Every journey starts with a single step... (Give)
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers_drifter()
		do save_npc()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- Get your head out of the clouds and face reality. (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do doom_player()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END

~ Introduction
The Drifter: Hmph. Another lost soul wandering around.
The Drifter: Don’t you know that it’s pointless? 
The Drifter: There’s no hope for any of us locked in here.
 => END

~ Reintroduction
The Drifter: What are you still doing here?
The Drifter: I’m not some animal to be gawked at. Leave me be.
 => END

~ Give_Dialogue
The Drifter: Fool. You really shouldn’t be so trusting.
The Drifter: I was like you once, I gave and gave and gave, and never received anything in return. 
The Drifter: I was left with nothing, abandoned in this cell. 
The Drifter: Now, I can finally be free.
The Drifter: …
The Drifter: What’s with that look in your eye? This is just how the world works.
The Drifter: …
The Drifter: …Fine. Take this.
 => END

~ Take_Dialogue
The Drifter: You’re just like all the rest. 
The Drifter: Well, jokes on you, because I have nothing left to give.
 => END